.
.  Create a GIF file for a lag plot
.
DEVICE 1 OFF
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
SKIP 25
READ LEW.DAT Y
.
TITLE AUTOMATIC
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
X1LABEL Beam Deflection (Time I-1)
Y1LABEL Beam Deflection (Time I)
LABEL SIZE 3
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL DISPLACEMENT 10
CHARACTER X
LINE BLANK
.
PRE-ERASE OFF
LAG PLOT Y
.
QUIT
